w.themoviedb.org/tv/284969/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"6890971","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Gengo goes in search of an old friend, and meets his son.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2026-02-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pKu39ij02oL6YX6LcYcz1sc4v5O.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pKu39ij02oL6YX6LcYcz1sc4v5O.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/284969/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"6890972","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"強風吹き荒れる夜、蕎麦屋・小諸屋で謎の爆発火災が発生。源吾たちは現場へ急行するが、店内には動かせぬ病の女将と彼女を見守るお鈴の姿があった。風向きの変化と再びの爆発の危険が迫り、森羅万象に通じ、火の動きを読む“風読み”が必要だった。源吾は星十郎を迎えに走る。星十郎は葛藤を乗り越え、命を救うために小諸屋へ。燃え盛る炎の中で、命の重みと絆が交錯する熱き救出劇がはじまる。\"","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2026-02-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5b410nq9YV7ICpU1EJhmXDvrLd0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5b410nq9YV7ICpU1EJhmXDvrLd0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/284969/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"6890973","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"空気が乾き、北風吹きすさぶ江戸の冬、大火が四ツ谷の町を襲う！“ぼろ鳶組”の前に立ちはだかるのは、江戸一番の人気と実力を兼ね備える火消組、“加賀鳶”。「寺社を守るのが我らの誇り」「命を守るのが、火消の本分だ！」激突する二つの信念。燃える紙問屋へと飛び込んだ源吾に、心の傷となった火への恐怖が再び襲いかかる！\n\n転がる“鐘”が運命を変える。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2026-02-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iX47FK4x2tQA5ZthTAvREsjBMFs.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iX47FK4x2tQA5ZthTAvREsjBMFs.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/284969/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"6890974","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"“ぼろ鳶組”は、被災した小諸屋の復旧を手伝う。その帰り道、源吾と妻・深雪は七年前の“あの日”を思い出す。当時、飯田町定火消の頭だった源吾は、仲間と溝ができていた。そんな中、深雪の父・右膳の屋敷が火事に！助けに向かった源吾だが、仲間たちがとった行動で窮地に立たされる。この火事こそが、源吾が火消を辞めるきっかけだったのだ。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2026-03-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wbNta8F7USPHGY580TUHWJYYkxU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wbNta8F7USPHGY580TUHWJYYkxU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/284969/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"6890975","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"江戸の町で、青白い炎を上げる謎の火事が連続して発生。源吾たちは現場に残された“狐”の印から、正体不明の放火魔“狐火”の存在を知る。星十郎は放火の手法を、燃える風・瓦斯によるものと見抜くものの、裏では“狐火”が不気味に笑い、さらに凶悪な陰謀を進めていた！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2026-03-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y3JmH5rF9hP8J2cQjEyvxYANQUq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y3JmH5rF9hP8J2cQjEyvxYANQUq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/284969/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"6890976","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"“狐火”と呼ばれる放火魔の正体が、かつての天才花火師『秀助』であることが判明する。秀助には、とある花火の実験で事故が起こり、妻子の命を奪われるという悲惨な過去が……。秀助は心を壊し、火消や世間を憎んでいた。復讐に囚われて炎を操る秀助は、江戸すべてを焼き尽くす大火を仕掛けようとしていた！一方、火付盗賊改方の長官・長谷川平蔵とともに、源吾たちぼろ鳶組は“狐火”を待ち構えるが、秀助の張った罠により火の手は瞬く間に広がる！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2026-03-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z5sJpqJAQtRo4HLr6E2nX2f5r1v.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z5sJpqJAQtRo4HLr6E2nX2f5r1v.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/284969/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"6890977","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"新之助が、父・蔵之介の墓参りの後に目黒の火事に遭遇。巨大な炎の奔流、“朱土竜”が仕掛けられた土蔵を発見する。源吾の「命を守ることが本分」という教えを胸に犬を助けようとするが、爆発に巻き込まれてしまう。絶望の淵にいた源吾だったが、この事件と左門の魂の叫びで復活し、燃え盛る江戸の街へと再び向かっていく。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2026-03-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lmjQH3AUFeEaBnW2Olzx2HluPCQ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lmjQH3AUFeEaBnW2Olzx2HluPCQ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/284969/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"6890978","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"江戸を焼き尽くす炎が永代橋を呑み込む。爆破された橋、崩れゆく避難路。源吾と仲間たちは命懸けで人々を救い出す。一方、深雪は母を探す少女お七と出会い、混乱の中で新之助の生存を知る。しかし、“狐火”の陰謀はまだ終わらない。燃え盛る深川、逃げ場を失った民衆。炎と涙が交錯する“明和の大火”が発生し、命を懸けた火消たちの闘いがはじまる！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2026-03-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uTLA4alOAsoJ7e0UQrRmFhLaYuW.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uTLA4alOAsoJ7e0UQrRmFhLaYuW.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/284969/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"6890979","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"江戸の空を焦がした大火。命を賭して火を制した火消たちの闘いは、まだ終わらない。復讐に囚われた“狐火”秀助と、憎しみを鎮めようとする源吾。交わる二つの炎が、ついに運命の夜を迎える。消せるのは、火か。それとも心の炎か","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2026-04-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7xHMDBZd26V9dNf9lix1v0UbvtS.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7xHMDBZd26V9dNf9lix1v0UbvtS.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/284969/season/1/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/284969/season/1"},"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793317321730,"status":"ok"},"2":{"checkedAt":1793317321730,"status":"ok"},"3":{"checkedAt":1793317321730,"status